          "message": "feat: add type hints to inlay hints provider (fixes #94) (#100)\n\n* feat: add type hints to inlay hints provider (fixes #94)\n\nEnhanced inlay hints to show parameter types in addition to parameter names:\n- Extract argTypes from Pike analyzer (already available at line 1164 of Parser.pike)\n- Format hints as \"paramName: type\" when type is available\n- Add configuration support via InlayHintsSettings.typeHints\n- Add inlayHint.resolve handler for future tooltip support\n\nBefore: `func(value)` → `func(x: value)`\nAfter: `func(value)` → `func(x: int value)` (when type is available)\n\nGenerated with AI\n\nCo-Authored-By: GLM-5\n\n* feat: add inlay hints configuration options\n\n- Add InlayHintsSettings interface with enabled, parameterNames, typeHints\n- Add inlayHints to PikeSettings (optional)\n- Update inlay-hints handler to respect configuration\n- Add getParamName helper for safe array access\n\nConfiguration:\n- enabled: boolean (default: true)\n- parameterNames: boolean (default: true)\n- typeHints: boolean (default: false)\n\nFixes #94\n\nGenerated with AI\n\nCo-Authored-By: GLM-5",
