          "distinct": true,
          "id": "9906bfd3369b16603d9e24388246b8cab536bb97",
          "message": "fix: OMC team integration and config-only push (#228)\n\n* fix: integrate OMC team mode into lead/executor roles\n\n- Remove disable-model-invocation from lead-startup and worker-orient skills\n- Add OMC Team workflow to lead role (TeamCreate, TaskCreate, Task)\n- Add idle worker management to prevent spawning while workers idle\n- Add shutdown protocol for idle workers\n- Update executor role to use TaskList/TaskUpdate/SendMessage\n\nGenerated with AI\n\nCo-Authored-By: MiniMax-M2.5\n\n* fix: add branch verification after worktree creation\n\nVerify we're on correct branch before TDD to prevent wrong folder mistakes.\n\nGenerated with AI\n\nCo-Authored-By: MiniMax-M2.5\n\n* fix: skip tests for config-only changes + allow .husky in main\n\n- Add pre-push check to skip tests when only .claude/, .husky/, scripts/ changed\n- Allow .husky/* in worktree-guard hook for config-only edits\n\nGenerated with AI\n\nCo-Authored-By: MiniMax-M2.5",
